			<div class="content" id="post-content-4855038">
									

<p>The draft is about a spacecraft and being roaming trough space and collecting stars. It needs some chipping away for sure. It has 3 list pages (a lot gets repeated but the total word count is 2k).</p>
<p><span style="text-decoration: underline;">The main things I want your opinion on</span></p>
<ul>
<li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">Is the second listpage good enough to be there or should I only include the first and last one? Or can I do something better for the transition?</span> Keeping it.</li>
<li>Is the dialogue good? The messages take a long time to get an answer in both ways but I want to know if it is good since I am bad at writing dialogue for the most part.</li>
<li>Is the twist pulled off successfully?</li>
</ul>
<p>Anyone reading for specifics only (clinical tone, SP&amp;G,&#8230;) is always welcome.</p>
<p><a href="http://kontainer.djkakt.us/collab:listpage-parent-test">Link to the draft</a></p>
<p>Thanks in advance.</p>

